WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.194 --> 00:00:06.195
You don't need money to launch your business.

00:00:06.195 --> 00:00:11.098
I can't tell you how many times people write in to me, they message me, they call my radio show and

00:00:11.098 --> 00:00:18.191
they ask me: "How do I get the $5,000... the $50,000... the $500,000 to launch my business?

00:00:18.191 --> 00:00:21.191
Because until that happens I can't do anything."

00:00:21.191 --> 00:00:23.120
And that's so wrong!

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:27.330
You don't need money to start your business. You don't need resources.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:31.597
You don't need an office. You don't need partners. You don't need anything.

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:33.940
You don't need a website to start your business.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:37.683
All you need is yourself and your resourcefulness.

00:00:37.683 --> 00:00:41.777
Because being an entrepreneur is going up against impossible odds

00:00:41.777 --> 00:00:44.020
and having people tell you you're never going to make it.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:49.625
And be constantly starved of resources and you find a way to make it happen.

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:55.630
And if you're the kind of person who's just sitting on an idea because you don't have money coming in,

00:00:55.630 --> 00:01:00.270
nobody's backing your project and that prevents you from starting,

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:02.549
you're not going to be successful.

00:01:02.549 --> 00:01:07.211
You have to find a way to start this thing up. Now.

00:01:07.211 --> 00:01:12.132
This comes as a result of a question from a YouTube viewer, love you guys, Corrine.

00:01:12.132 --> 00:01:16.293
Corrine writes in to say: "I have a board game that I came up with, but the only manufacturer

00:01:16.293 --> 00:01:21.158
I could find wants US$5,000 to manufacture my game and then I have to worry about marketing,

00:01:21.158 --> 00:01:24.916
how would you suggest I get that going?"

00:01:24.916 --> 00:01:28.000
So, Corrine, you don't need the US$5,000.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.690
Don't go out and spend money. I don't want you taking US$5,000 out of your bank account,

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:37.336
out of your savings, borrowing it from friends and family. Don't do that

00:01:37.336 --> 00:01:39.279
to launch this business.

00:01:39.279 --> 00:01:41.242
You don't need that.

00:01:41.242 --> 00:01:47.007
You need to find a way to make money before you're spending it.

00:01:47.007 --> 00:01:52.522
This is a critical rule: Stop spending money until you're making money.

00:01:52.522 --> 00:01:55.024
There's a lot of ways you could get this thing going.

00:01:55.024 --> 00:01:59.613
Start getting some pre-orders. Go to Facebook, create a campaign.

00:01:59.613 --> 00:02:02.902
Use your social media, use your friends, use your contacts.

00:02:02.902 --> 00:02:05.072
Go on Kickstarter.

00:02:05.072 --> 00:02:07.814
Ok? If you haven't heard of Kickstarter, go to to Kickstarter.com.

00:02:07.814 --> 00:02:12.768
You can post your idea there and people will essentially pre-order your product.

00:02:12.768 --> 00:02:15.490
You say "I'm making this board game, here's what it's all about."

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:19.581
And this will take care of your funding and also take care of your marketing,

00:02:19.581 --> 00:02:21.740
at least in the start-up phase.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:27.241
And it'll give you feedback as to whether people think this is a great idea or not.

00:02:27.241 --> 00:02:32.750
If you put this idea up on Kickstarter and you explain everything and you're passionate in your video.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:38.778
And you explain what this board game is meant to do and why it's so great and nobody buys it,

00:02:38.778 --> 00:02:41.806
the market might be telling you something.

00:02:41.806 --> 00:02:44.635
Because here is what most people do:

00:02:44.635 --> 00:02:48.337
Most people who are thinking of a product, they'll go out and they'll make it.

00:02:48.337 --> 00:02:53.585
And they'll take a loan out or they'll cash out their savings to make this product.

00:02:53.585 --> 00:03:00.691
And it sits in their garage. They try to sell it, nobody buys it and they're just sitting on inventory

00:03:00.691 --> 00:03:05.120
in their apartment, in their garage, in their basement; that they don't know what to do with.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:10.841
And they're stuck paying this loan every month back. And I don't want that to be you.

00:03:10.841 --> 00:03:16.596
You have to show to yourself that you have a winning idea.

00:03:17.427 --> 00:03:23.210
And you have to start generating some momentum with it and some pre-orders on your concept

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:25.246
before you go and actually make it.

00:03:25.246 --> 00:03:28.714
It's great that you went and you costed it out, ok? So you know it's going to cost you $5K

00:03:28.714 --> 00:03:33.312
to manufacture it. But lots of people can manufacture it.

00:03:33.312 --> 00:03:36.318
The harder part is the marketing, getting sales.

00:03:36.318 --> 00:03:40.855
And you don't need to have the finished product to start getting some sales on it.

00:03:40.855 --> 00:03:42.731
You can get pre-orders.

00:03:42.731 --> 00:03:47.539
And you need people to show you that this is a great idea before you start investing your

00:03:47.539 --> 00:03:50.964
own money and your savings into it.

00:03:50.964 --> 00:03:55.519
It's so important and it's teaching you a great lesson for everything as you continue

00:03:55.519 --> 00:03:59.397
growing this business up. And for all of you watching:

00:03:59.397 --> 00:04:02.442
Stop spending money.

00:04:02.442 --> 00:04:05.270
Because you end up spending...

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:07.815
It's a real problem!

00:04:07.815 --> 00:04:12.482
You end up spending all your money on this thing, whatever idea you have.

00:04:12.482 --> 00:04:15.865
And I get that, you know? You're the only one who believes in this thing.

00:04:15.865 --> 00:04:21.013
And you want to make this happen and nobody's supporting you.

00:04:21.013 --> 00:04:24.236
And so you cash out whatever you have to invest it into the company.

00:04:24.236 --> 00:04:27.943
But I don't want you to go bankrupt on this thing.

00:04:27.943 --> 00:04:33.613
And there may be a way better way to launch this thing or way better features to add to it

00:04:33.613 --> 00:04:35.626
or a completely different concept all together.

00:04:35.626 --> 00:04:42.294
And you won't have anything to help you get through it and you'll be stuck paying off this crushing debt.

00:04:42.294 --> 00:04:46.091
For the rest of your life, potentially.

00:04:46.091 --> 00:04:50.263
And I don't want that for you. I want you to be successful. I want you to be happy.

00:04:50.263 --> 00:04:53.614
I want you to change the world through your products and services.

00:04:53.614 --> 00:04:57.592
So stop spending money until you're making money.

00:04:57.592 --> 00:04:59.293
Believe!

00:04:59.293 --> 00:05:02.297
For those of you watching and liked the video, thumbs up below.

00:05:02.297 --> 00:05:04.417
Let me know what you think, leave a comment underneath.

00:05:04.417 --> 00:05:08.046
If you have a question for me I'll make a video response if you ask your question below.

00:05:08.046 --> 00:05:10.714
Thank you so much! And I'll see you soon.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:18.000
